0 -15 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(7.1 Login mpaka dashboard) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(1. The user logs in through the login form.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(2. If credentials are valid, the system redirects the user to OTP verification.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(3. The OTP is sent by email and stored in `otp_codes`.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(4. When the user verifies the OTP, the session gets `otp_verified = true`.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(5. The user can then access the dashboard and other routes protected by `auth` and) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(`otp`.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(7.2 Participant create/update flow) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(1. The user opens the participant form.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(2. The system validates the submitted fields.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(3. The center scope is determined from the authenticated user.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(4. A local participant ID is generated.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(5. If a photo is uploaded, the file is stored and the next photo due date is set.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(6. Sponsorship summary data may be synchronized to the participant.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(7. A create or update notification may be generated.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(7.3 Access control flow) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(1. The system checks the user role.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(2. The system resolves `accessibleCenterIds\(\)`.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(3. Most queries are filtered through the `forCenter\(...\)` scope.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(4. This prevents cross-center data access.) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 11 Tf
() Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 13 Tf
